Sam: Not yet. I''m thinking about the Ballet Club or the Debate Club.
Adam: Do you like dancing or speaking more?
Sam: Actually, I enjoy discussing different topics.
Adam: Then the Debate Club is suitable for you.
Sam: Good idea! What about you?
Adam: I joined the Volunteer Club. Every week we help homeless people.
Sam: That sounds great. I''ll sign up for the Debate Club today.', 'Adam 问 Sam 选社团了吗;Sam 在芭蕾社和辩论社之间犹豫,说自己喜欢讨论不同话题;Adam 建议他选辩论社,并说自己加入了志愿者社、每周帮助无家可归的人;Sam 决定今天就报名辩论社。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Which two clubs is Sam choosing between?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The Ballet Club and the Debate Club.","The Nature Club and the Music Club.","The Volunteer Club and the Art Club.","The Football Club and the Chess Club."]},{"q":"What does Sam enjoy doing?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Dancing.","Discussing different topics.","Growing plants.","Playing football."]},{"q":"Which club does Adam suggest for Sam?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["The Ballet Club.","The Volunteer Club.","The Debate Club.","The Nature Club."]},{"q":"Which club did Adam join?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The Volunteer Club.","The Debate Club.","The Ballet Club.","The Music Club."]},{"q":"What will Sam do today?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Join the Ballet Club.","Quit the club.","Help homeless people.","Sign up for the Debate Club."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1');
In the morning I felt a little anxious because I am not very outgoing.
My first maths class was difficult, but the teacher was kind and friendly.
He told us a funny story, and everyone laughed.
In the afternoon, the boy next to me talked too much, so I couldn''t concentrate.
By the evening, I felt much more confident, and I made two new friends.', '今天是我高中第一天。早上因为不太外向有点紧张;第一节数学课很难,但老师很和善,还讲了个有趣的故事,大家都笑了;下午旁边的男生话太多,我无法集中注意力;到傍晚我自信多了,还交了两个新朋友。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How did the speaker feel in the morning?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["A little anxious.","Very angry.","Quite bored.","Very proud."]},{"q":"Why did the speaker feel anxious?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["He was late.","He is not very outgoing.","He forgot his books.","He was ill."]},{"q":"What was the first maths class like?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Easy but boring.","Short and noisy.","Difficult, but the teacher was kind.","Cancelled."]},{"q":"Why couldn''t the speaker concentrate in the afternoon?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["The boy next to him talked too much.","The class was too long.","He felt sick.","The room was cold."]},{"q":"How did the speaker feel by the evening?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Tired and sad.","Still anxious.","Angry with friends.","Much more confident."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U1');
Li Ming: I take notes in class and review them every evening.
Amy: Do you also watch English videos?
Li Ming: Yes, I watch short videos and try to copy the pronunciation.
Amy: That''s helpful. I like to make mind maps to organise my ideas.
Li Ming: Good idea. We can share our methods with each other.
Amy: Great! Working together makes learning more fun.', 'Amy 问李明英语为什么学得好;李明:上课记笔记、每晚复习,还看短视频模仿发音;Amy 喜欢用思维导图整理想法;两人决定互相分享方法,一起学习更有趣。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Li Ming do every evening?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Reviews his notes.","Plays games.","Watches TV shows.","Goes to a club."]},{"q":"How does Li Ming improve his pronunciation?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["By singing songs.","By copying short videos.","By reading novels.","By making mind maps."]},{"q":"What does Amy like to make?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Word cards.","Posters.","Mind maps.","Schedules."]},{"q":"What do they decide to do?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Share their learning methods.","Join the same club.","Stop studying English.","Watch a film together."]},{"q":"What does Amy think about working together?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It is a waste of time.","It is too difficult.","It is boring.","It makes learning more fun."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1');
He spends too much time online and cannot focus on his studies.
I am worried about him.
Our teacher says it is normal for teenagers to be attracted to games.
But she also says spending too much time online is unhealthy.
She recommends that we try new hobbies, such as sports or reading.', '我的朋友陈磊玩电脑游戏太频繁,上网太久,无法专心学习,我很担心他;老师说青少年被游戏吸引很正常,但上网太久不健康,建议大家尝试运动、阅读等新爱好。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What is Chen Lei''s problem?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["He plays computer games too often.","He never does sports.","He has no friends.","He reads too much."]},{"q":"How does the speaker feel about Chen Lei?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Proud.","Worried.","Angry.","Bored."]},{"q":"What does the teacher say about teenagers and games?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["They should never play.","It is normal to be attracted to games.","Games are good for study.","Only adults like games."]},{"q":"Why is spending too much time online a problem?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["It is unhealthy.","It costs no money.","It is against the law.","It is too easy."]},{"q":"What does the teacher recommend?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Playing more games.","Staying online longer.","Stopping school.","Trying new hobbies."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U1');
Cao Jing: Sure! What kind of camp is it?
Max: There are two. One is an adventure camp where we learn survival skills.
Cao Jing: That sounds exciting! What about the other one?
Max: It''s an international youth camp. We can practise spoken English there.
Cao Jing: I''d like to improve my English, so I prefer the youth camp.
Max: Good choice. We''ll also meet students from different countries.', 'Max 问曹静要不要参加夏令营;有两个:一个是学野外生存技能的探险营,一个是能练口语的国际青年营;曹静想提高英语,更喜欢青年营;Max 说在那儿还能认识来自不同国家的学生。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How many camps does Max mention?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Two.","Three.","One.","Four."]},{"q":"What can students learn at the adventure camp?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Cooking.","Survival skills.","Dancing.","Painting."]},{"q":"Why does Cao Jing prefer the youth camp?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["It is cheaper.","It is nearer.","She wants to improve her English.","It is shorter."]},{"q":"What can they do at the international youth camp?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Practise spoken English.","Learn to make a fire.","Live in the wild.","Grow plants."]},{"q":"Who will they meet at the youth camp?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Only their classmates.","Famous actors.","Their teachers.","Students from different countries."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'required1', 'U1');
At home, they help their parents and take care of themselves.
At school, they are responsible for their own studies and behaviour.
When you show that you can be responsible, adults trust you more.
For example, if you finish your homework on time, your parents will not worry.
No one becomes responsible in a single day, but we can learn from our mistakes.', '随着青少年长大,他们要对更多事情负责:在家帮父母、照顾自己;在校对自己的学业和行为负责;当你表现得有责任心,大人会更信任你;比如按时完成作业,父母就不担心;没人能一天就变得有责任心,但我们能从错误中学习。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What happens as teenagers grow up?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["They become responsible for more things.","They have fewer duties.","They stop studying.","They leave home."]},{"q":"What are teenagers responsible for at school?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["Cleaning the school.","Their own studies and behaviour.","Teaching classes.","Cooking lunch."]},{"q":"What happens when you show you are responsible?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["You get more homework.","You lose free time.","Adults trust you more.","Friends stop liking you."]},{"q":"What example does the speaker give?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Finishing homework on time.","Playing sports every day.","Going to bed early.","Joining a club."]},{"q":"What does the speaker say about becoming responsible?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["It happens in one day.","It is impossible.","It needs no effort.","We can learn from our mistakes."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'short', 'required1', 'U1');

