称呼:Dear … ,
第1步 点明问题:You wrote that … 
第2步 表示理解:I understand that you feel … 
第3步 给建议+理由:I think you should … / Why not … ? They can help you … 
第4步 鼓励结尾:I am sure that … 
落款:Best wishes, + 署名', 3, 'required1', 'U1');

